## Strings used by attachment actions: saving, opening, detaching and deleting.

# Variables:
#   $attachments (String) - Newline separated list of attachment names.
attachment-delete-confirm =
    Imaddayen-agi ad ttwakksen ilebda seg izen:
    { $attachments }
    Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer deffir. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemleḍ?
# Variables:
#   $attachments (String) - Newline separated list of attachment names.
attachment-detach-confirm =
    Imaddayen-agi ttwakelsen akken iwata, tura ad ttwakksen ilebda seg izen-agi:
    { $attachments }
    Ur tezmireḍ ara ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer deffir. Tebɣiḍ ad tkemleḍ?
attachment-empty =
    Amedday-agi yettban-d d ilem.
    Ma ulac aɣilif, senqed akked umdan i d-yuznen w-agi.
    Iɣraben n tmes n tkebbaniyin neɣ iseɣẓanen mgal n ivirusen ad hudden imeddayen.
attachment-external-not-found = Afaylu-a i inesren neɣ taceqquft yeddan ulac-itt neɣ ur yettwakcam ara deg wadig-a.
